title: file:trash
tags: [[GUI command]] Trash
kind: reference
summary: Send a panel's files to the trash, metarecords with them (self / a panel type)

Sends each file the panel designates to the repository's trash, its metarecords with it — what `mf trash -f` does; a file no repository holds goes to the desktop's trash ([[The desktop trash]]). Nothing is forced: a reference from another metarecord is a refusal. See [[Sending files to the trash]]; one of the [[File commands]]. It used to be `metarecord:trash`, which acts first on the file: a file with no metarecord goes the same way.
